{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/203418-is-onyx-path-publishing-intrested-in-new-non-white-wolf-rpg-ideas","id":203418,"title":"Is Onyx Path Publishing intrested in new non White Wolf RPG ideas","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-20T20:34:30-07:00","id":203418,"title":"Is Onyx Path Publishing intrested in new non White Wolf RPG ideas","content":"Hi I'm am a Canadian person who has Abesbergers, now I would like to create some RPG's that aren't White Wolf, is Onyx Path interested?.<br /> <br /> I'm fan of alt history, secret history, retro future tech and buildings.<br /> <br /> <br /> LW","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3380-martian1912","name":"Martian1912","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"40"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T22:50:00-07:00","id":203541,"title":"","content":"*Asperger's<br /> <br /> I only felt the need to correct that because I've spent a few years learning to differentiate the symptoms of my PTSD and bipolar disorder from behaviors that predate their emergence or seem entirely unrelated, that are very likely signs of high functioning Autism. I say high functioning Autism because Asperger's has been subsumed under the umbrella of Autism Spectrum Disorders, and therefore is no longer a legitimate diagnosis.<br /> <br /> I have no frigging clue about the WW/OPP stuff, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 07-21-2014, 01:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T22:51:11-07:00","id":203546,"title":"","content":"Onyx Path is not accepting new RPG ideas from the consumer base at this time.<br /> <br /> THey might be willing to chat with freelancers, and Devs definitely stand a chance of being heard.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T05:33:29-07:00","id":203753,"title":"","content":"RPGs are too much a gamble to spend money on unless the RPG in question already has a dedicated fan base. Kickstarters are the way to go these days.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T08:58:06-07:00","id":203884,"title":"","content":"It is worth noting that Onyx Path has Cavaliers of Mars in the works, which is not a White Wolf holdover, though based on the Wushu RPG system. Onyx Path isn't just a company for making the old WW games.<br /> <br /> However, as ArcaneArts pointed out, that doesn't mean Onyx Path is taking open submissions.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-21T11:16:50-07:00","id":203986,"title":"","content":"There is even some debate among the Autism community over the usage of terms like &quot;high functioning&quot; and &quot;low functioning&quot;.<br /> I'm similar to Azrael, I happen to receive a diagnosis of Asperger's when it was legitimate in the 90's. Before then, I was misdiagnosed with (<i>As I'm sure many others with Autism were in the 80's</i>) childhood schizophrenia.<br /> And yes, Asperger's was replaced with Autism Spectrum Disorder in the DSM-5 in 2013.<br /> <br /> <b>To the OP:</b> While a fan of &quot;alt history, secret history, retro future tech and buildings&quot;, I would also suggest looking up or getting books on Game Design (<i>Ones that are geared towards RPGs and Board Games</i>) if you wanted to go Indie. For Onyx Path, I think it would be best to wait for when they have Open Submissions.<br /> <br /> Also, what Future Retro Tech are you into? As there are different eras and alt. histories for them. Do you mean Steam-punk, Diesel-punk, Deco-punk, Atompunk (<i>Raygun Gothic</i>), etc.?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}